{"repositoryId":1210534143,"availability":"available","full":"avikalpg/byok-relay","name":"byok-relay","description":"Bring your own key (BYOK) relay to enable lightweight frontend-only apps to use LLMs using the user's API keys without hitting CORS.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":55,"forks":1,"created":"2026-04-14T14:06:56Z","updated":"2026-09-20T08:04:45Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://byokrelay.com","topics":["ai","ai-gateway","anthropic","api-proxy","bring-your-own-key","browser-safe","byok","cors","gemini","llm","llm-gateway","llmops","no-backend","nodejs","openai","relay","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://codespaces.new/avikalpg/byok-relay?quickstart=1","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.743Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.743Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.743Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.743Z","stars":55,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Website: byokrelay.com | Hosted relay: relay.byokrelay.com","Your users bring their own AI keys. byok-relay lets them use those keys straight from the browser — CORS handled, keys never in your code, costs on their bill.","Browser apps can't call api.openai.com or api.anthropic.com directly — CORS blocks them. The usual fix (a backend proxy) puts your users' keys — and your users' AI costs — on your tab. byok-relay flips this: each user gets a secure token; they store their own key; they pay for their own inference. You build the product."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byok-relay/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b9a17f1854312f5e9fc314be0d0b884d7900cfb4b889bc5eb017cb801600ff86","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.838Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:31.838Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Website: byokrelay.com | Hosted relay: relay.byokrelay.com","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/avikalpg/byo